<title>USA: IWI Holding Ltd Q4 Dec 31 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>IWI Holding Ltd Q4 Dec 31 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMONT, Ill. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.49     loss	 $0.72</p>
<p> Net loss		   1,284     loss	 1,891</p>
<p> Revs			11,054		   13,054</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Auditors have said there is uncertainty about IWI Holding's ability to remain a &quot;going concern&quot; because IWI reported operating losses in both 1995 and 1996 and because IWI's principal lender has not committed to ongoing financing, the company said.  </p>
<p>	  YEAR</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.25     loss	 $0.53</p>
<p> Net loss		   5,936     loss	 1,384</p>
<p> Revs			30,840		   41,710</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: '96 results include about $3 million of losses from the reduction of inventory, including a reserve of $1.6 million for the anticipated losses from the completion of the inventory reduction plan in 1997.</p>
</text>
